First, include the DOMPurify library in your project. If you use npm, install it like this:

```bash
npm install dompurify
```

Then update your `sanitizeUserInput` function like this:

```javascript
import DOMPurify from 'dompurify';

function sanitizeUserInput(input) {
    // Use DOMPurify to sanitize input
    return DOMPurify.sanitize(input);
}
